<title>MALAYSIA: Malaysia Apex says bonus issue approved.</title>
<headline>Malaysia Apex says bonus issue approved.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1997-06-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Apex Equity Holdings Bhd said the Securities Commission has approved a bonus issue of one share for every one held against its proposal of two-for-one.</p>
<p>It said the one-for-one bonus will capitalise 76.40 million ringgit from the reserves at one ringgit per share.</p>
<p>Apex is involved in stockbroking and property business.</p>
<p>-- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603-201 4813)</p>
